  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "だい３のあしが　たたまれている。ピンチになると　１０メートルいじょうジャンプする　きゃくりょくを　もつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "제3의 다리가 접혀 있다. 위기에 처하면 10m 이상을 점프하는 다릿심을 가지고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "總是將第３對腳折起來。擁有在遇到危機時能夠跳超過１０公尺的跳躍力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa troisième paire de pattes est repliée. Il possède assez de force pour sauter à plus de dix mètres lorsqu’il est en difficulté.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein drittes Beinpaar ist eingeklappt. In einer Notlage kann es dank dessen Kraft mehr als 10 m weit springen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mantiene plegado su tercer par de patas, cuya fuerza le permite saltar a más de 10 m de altura para huir en caso de apuro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Di solito tiene ripiegato su di sé un terzo paio di zampe, la cui potenza gli permette di spiccare salti di oltre 10 metri nei momenti di pericolo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has its third set of legs folded up. When it’s in a tough spot, this Pokémon jumps over 30 feet using the strength of its legs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "第３の脚が　畳まれている。ピンチになると　１０メートル以上ジャンプする　脚力を　持つ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "总是将第３双脚折起来。拥有陷入危机时能够跳跃１０米以上的脚力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mantiene plegado su tercer par de patas, cuya fuerza le permite saltar a más de 10 m de altura para huir en caso de apuro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ジャンプりょくを　いかしてあいての　こうげきを　かわしながらダメージを　あたえる　たたかいかたが　とくい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "점프력을 이용하여 상대의 공격을 피하며 데미지를 주는 전법이 특기다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "活用跳躍力閃避攻擊並同時給予對手傷害，是牠很擅長的戰鬥方式。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En combat, sa capacité à bondir lui permet d’infliger des dégâts tout en évitant les attaques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Kampf ist es darauf spezialisiert, mithilfe seiner Sprungkraft gegnerischen Angriffen auszuweichen und gleichzeitig Schaden auszuteilen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su estilo de lucha característico aprovecha su formidable capacidad de salto para esquivar los ataques del rival mientras lo va dañando.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto abile nello sfruttare le proprie capacità di salto per schivare gli attacchi avversari e infliggere danni allo stesso tempo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s highly skilled at a fighting style in which it uses its jumping capabilities to dodge incoming attacks while also dealing damage to opponents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ジャンプ力を　活かして相手の　攻撃を　かわしながらダメージを　与える　戦い方が　得意。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "活用跳跃力来闪避攻击，并同时给予对手伤害，是它很擅长的战斗方式。",
      "language": {
